WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.574
- HELLO, EVERYONE.

00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:11.210
I'M JOSEPH CARMICHAEL.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:17.216
OTIS IS--WAS MY FATHER.

00:00:17.216 --> 00:00:20.587
BUT WE ARE NOT HERE TODAY
TO MOURN HIS DEATH,

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:22.755
BUT TO CELEBRATE HIS LIFE.

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:26.525
WE KNEW OTIS AS A TEACHER,
A COMMUNITY LEADER,

00:00:26.525 --> 00:00:30.196
A ROLE MODEL, A HUSBAND,
AND A FATHER.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.198
NOW, I THOUGHT
IT WOULD BE NICE

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:35.568
TO SHARE SOMETHING ABOUT HIM
Y'ALL MAY NOT HAVE KNOWN.

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:37.236
WHEN MY FATHER WAS YOUNGER,

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:39.104
HE WAS AN ACTOR
IN HOLLYWOOD.

00:00:39.104 --> 00:00:41.407
GOING THROUGH MY DAD'S THINGS,

00:00:41.407 --> 00:00:45.244
I FOUND THIS REEL OF HIS WORK
AS AN ACTOR.

00:00:45.244 --> 00:00:46.879
I HAVEN'T SEEN IT YET,

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:49.448
BUT I THOUGHT
IT WOULD BE FUN TO WATCH,

00:00:49.448 --> 00:00:52.886
HERE WITH ALL OF YOU TODAY.

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:57.824
THANK YOU.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:11.404
- [gasps]
WHERE ARE MY PIES?

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:15.608
RIBBLES, WHERE ARE THE PIES
I PUT ON MY WINDOWSILL?

00:01:16.909 --> 00:01:20.947
- WHY, I DON'T KNOW,
MRS. CARUTHERS.

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:22.414
WHY WOULD ANYONE
WANT TO STEAL

00:01:22.414 --> 00:01:26.619
ONE OF YOUR DELICIOUS
BLUEBERRY PIES?

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:30.689
- [snaps]
HEY.

00:01:30.689 --> 00:01:33.125
SEE TO IT YOU SHINE
THOSE SHOES UP NICE, BOY.

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:36.929
- YES, SIR,
YOU BEST BE BELIEVING I WILL!

00:01:36.929 --> 00:01:40.700
I'LL SHINE YOUR SHOES BLACKER
THAN MY MAMA'S BOOTY.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.468
[all gasp]

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:46.005
[laughs]

00:01:51.477 --> 00:01:57.149
[yelling]

00:01:57.149 --> 00:01:58.484
OOGA-BOOGA!

00:01:58.484 --> 00:02:00.486
OOGA-BOOGA SHOO!
OOGA-BOOGA SHOO!

00:02:00.486 --> 00:02:01.954
OOGA-BOOGA!
- OH, HELL NO!

00:02:01.954 --> 00:02:04.457
- OOGA-BOOGA SHOO!
[yelling]

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:26.813
- IN 1964,
MY FATHER MARCHED

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:30.150
WITH MARTIN LUTHER KING JR.
AND HARRY BELAFONTE

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:33.019
ALONG WITH OTHER RENOWNED
CIVIL RIGHTS LEADERS.

